WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.970
- Before we say goodbye,

00:00:00.970 --> 00:00:02.600
we'd love to play a quick round of!

00:00:02.600 --> 00:00:03.551
- Drewth or Dare.

00:00:03.551 --> 00:00:06.770
(audience applauds)

00:00:06.770 --> 00:00:09.300
- We have Stacey Louise Jacques.

00:00:09.300 --> 00:00:10.296
- [Ross] Hi, Stacey!

00:00:10.296 --> 00:00:11.129
- Hi.

00:00:11.129 --> 00:00:11.962
- [Ross] How are you?

00:00:11.962 --> 00:00:12.857
- I'm great, how are you guys?

00:00:12.857 --> 00:00:13.690
- Good.
- Good.

00:00:13.690 --> 00:00:15.678
- I love your beautiful
bright colored top.

00:00:15.678 --> 00:00:16.511
- Oh, thank you.

00:00:16.511 --> 00:00:17.930
- All right, so we're
down. What is it gonna be?

00:00:17.930 --> 00:00:19.120
A Drewth or a dare?

00:00:19.120 --> 00:00:20.440
- [Stacey] I have a Drewth.

00:00:20.440 --> 00:00:21.273
- Okay.

00:00:21.273 --> 00:00:24.013
- Have you ever snuck out of
a date before it was over?

00:00:25.831 --> 00:00:26.664
(Stacey laughs)

00:00:26.664 --> 00:00:28.710
- I wish I knew that I could.

00:00:28.710 --> 00:00:30.120
- Oh, yeah, right?

00:00:30.120 --> 00:00:32.460
- I am that person, also, who like,

00:00:32.460 --> 00:00:35.300
goes to a long winded meal.

00:00:35.300 --> 00:00:37.550
Yeah, at 47, I'm finally learning,

00:00:37.550 --> 00:00:39.540
don't do a meal on a date.

00:00:39.540 --> 00:00:41.300
Is this something everybody knows?

00:00:41.300 --> 00:00:42.230
- Oh yeah.
(audience laughs)

00:00:42.230 --> 00:00:44.850
- So no, I would like hot tips.

00:00:44.850 --> 00:00:47.510
In fact, write in to
TheDrewBarryMoreShow.com

00:00:47.510 --> 00:00:50.150
and let us know a good way
to get out of a bad date.

00:00:50.150 --> 00:00:51.060
- Yeah.
(audience applauds)

00:00:51.060 --> 00:00:53.350
I have never, ever snuck out of a date.

00:00:53.350 --> 00:00:54.830
No, no, no.

00:00:54.830 --> 00:00:55.910
I mean, I wanted to leave,

00:00:55.910 --> 00:00:57.030
I just was grateful to be there,

00:00:57.030 --> 00:00:57.863
'cause it was dinner.

00:00:57.863 --> 00:00:58.793
You understand what I'm saying?

00:00:58.793 --> 00:00:59.920
(audience laughs)
Like...

00:00:59.920 --> 00:01:01.190
It was good.

00:01:01.190 --> 00:01:02.330
- What about you, Stacey?

00:01:02.330 --> 00:01:04.020
Have you ever snuck out of a date?

00:01:04.020 --> 00:01:04.920
- Uh...

00:01:04.920 --> 00:01:06.660
Well, I have never actually done it,

00:01:06.660 --> 00:01:08.520
but there was a time that I wish I did.

00:01:08.520 --> 00:01:10.350
- Yeah, we've all been there.

00:01:10.350 --> 00:01:12.000
- You know what you gotta do, the move?

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:13.587
Is give like, your best friend, say,

00:01:13.587 --> 00:01:14.717
"Hey, call me 15 minutes into it."

00:01:14.717 --> 00:01:16.595
- Everybody knows that!

00:01:16.595 --> 00:01:19.600
Everybody knows that the
phone call is a ruse!

00:01:19.600 --> 00:01:21.410
- I know, you should see
me fake it, I can do it.

00:01:21.410 --> 00:01:22.680
- All right, do it right now.

00:01:22.680 --> 00:01:23.570
- Oh, Drew, I'm so sorry.

00:01:23.570 --> 00:01:25.250
Oh no! I'm sorry.

00:01:25.250 --> 00:01:26.670
My um,

00:01:26.670 --> 00:01:27.503
cat is hungry.

00:01:27.503 --> 00:01:28.941
I have to go!
(audience laughs)

00:01:28.941 --> 00:01:29.774
- Yeah, forget it.
(audience applauds)

00:01:29.774 --> 00:01:31.344
Well, thank you, Stacey.

00:01:31.344 --> 00:01:33.927
(upbeat music)

